for(const [id,key] of [['quality','quality'],['botCount','bots'],['difficulty','difficulty'],['sensitivity','sensitivity'],['volume','volume']]){$(id).value=settings[key];$(id).addEventListener('change',()=>{settings[key]=['bots','sensitivity','volume'].includes(key)?Number($(id).value):$(id).value;saveSettings();if(key==='quality')applyQuality();if(master)master.gain.value=settings.volume*.3;});}
{const ms=$('mapSelect');ms.value=C.MAP.id;ms.addEventListener('change',()=>{settings.map=ms.value;saveSettings();$('loadStatus').textContent=ms.value==='island'?'Carregando a Ilha do Medo…':'Carregando Aurora…';show('loading');const u=new URL(location.href);u.searchParams.delete('map');setTimeout(()=>location.replace(u.toString()),60);});$('mapName').textContent=C.MAP.id==='island'?'ILHA DO MEDO':'AURORA';}
